sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application / ORM
    participant DB as Database Engine

    Note over App,DB: The N+1 Anti-Pattern (1 initial query + N follow-up queries)
    App->>DB: 1. SELECT * FROM authors LIMIT 100;
    DB-->>App: Returns 100 Author records
    loop For each of the 100 authors
        App->>DB: SELECT * FROM books WHERE author_id = ?;
        DB-->>App: Returns Books
    end
    Note over App,DB: Total DB roundtrips = 1 + 100 = 101 queries (High latency & overhead)

    Note over App,DB: The Eager Loading / Batching Solution (1 or 2 queries)
    App->>DB: SELECT * FROM authors LIMIT 100;
    DB-->>App: Returns 100 Author records (IDs: 1..100)
    App->>DB: SELECT * FROM books WHERE author_id IN (1, 2, ..., 100);
    DB-->>App: Returns all associated books in single roundtrip
    Note over App,DB: Total DB roundtrips = 2 queries
